WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.980
Hey kids — have you heard about this place?

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:04.670
Old brick warehouses turned into shops and cafes.

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:08.110
Look! The string lights glow over the brick streets!

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:09.590
And the market hums along.
